nline with Remote Play Together </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs away! Blast your friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Controllers are required for local multiplayer</i></p>",
